---
import LegalPage from "../layouts/LegalPage.astro";

const title = "Language Policy Statement · Donegal Airport";
const description = "Donegal Airport's Language Policy Statement under the Official Languages Act.";
---

<LegalPage
  title={title}
  description={description}
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Language Policy Statement"
>
  <p>
    Donegal Airport sits at the heart of one of Ireland's largest Gaeltacht regions, and this
    website is published bilingually in English and Irish for that reason — every page here has a
    full Irish version at the <a href="/ga">/ga</a> equivalent.
  </p>
  <p>
    Donegal Airport recognises the importance of delivering services in both Irish and English to
    adequately meet the needs of its entire customer base.
  </p>
  <p>
    Donegal Airport will supply sufficient resources to implement a language policy to deliver
    services in both official languages.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Manager, through this resolution, hereby endorses efforts to implement service delivery in
    both official languages in all relevant areas related to the organisation's activities.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
